hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1534","On the authority of Muhammad bin Bashar Bundar, on the authority of Muhammad, meaning Ibn Jafar, on the authority of Shu’bah, on the authority of Salamah, who is Ibn Kuhayl, on the authority of Kurayb, on the authority of Ibn Abbas He said: “I spent the night at my aunt Maymunah’s house, so I followed how the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, prayed. Then he got up to pray, so I came and stood beside him. So I stood on his left, and he said: Then he took me and placed me on his right.”"
